# Privileged Access Groups (PAG)

## Overview

Privileged Access Groups improve governance of administrative access by controlling privileged group membership using Microsoft Entra ID.

## Purpose

Privileged groups help reduce excessive administrative permissions and improve privileged access governance.

## Security Benefits

- Improved privileged access governance
- Reduced excessive permissions
- Improved least privilege access
- Improved administrative accountability

## Zero Trust Alignment

- Verify explicitly
- Least privilege access
- Assume breach